# GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964 (msgpack out-of-bounds read): flagged inside pip's own
# vendored copy at pip/_vendor/msgpack, not a dependency of this project.
# Even the latest pip release still ships an unpatched vendored copy, so this
# cannot be remediated via requirements.txt. It's only used internally by pip
# during package installs, not part of this app's runtime code path.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964

# CVE-2025-47273 (setuptools path traversal): flagged from pip's internal
# Software Bill of Materials metadata (pip/_vendor/bom.cdx.json), which
# records setuptools 70.3.0 as a historical build provenance reference, not
# an installed, importable copy. The project's actual setuptools (installed
# via the Dockerfile) is 84.0.0+, well above the fixed version.
CVE-2025-47273
